  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Four transformations move shapes around the plane, and column vectors describe the moves precisely. A full description must name the transformation <em>and</em> its defining data.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "note",
        "label": {
          "en": "● The four transformations",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<strong>Translation</strong> — give the column vector. <strong>Reflection</strong> — give the mirror line. <strong>Rotation</strong> — give the centre, angle and direction. <strong>Enlargement</strong> — give the centre and scale factor (a fraction shrinks; a negative factor flips through the centre).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
